    class ManageTeam,AssistantCoach,PlayerView,ValidateCredentials,ValidateCode,PlayGame,SubmitAssembly,PollAssembly,FetchSentences,LoadSettings,DetectCallouts,DeadAir,DeadAirAnnotation,Alignment,CoachActions,PlayerActions,WaitMore,TranscriptFailed,ManualEvents processNode
    class CheckAccount,TeamChoice,MainCoachDecides,RoleGate,ConsentGate,LangCheck,DeadAirNote,AlignStep,ReadyGate,ReviewComplete,Reopen,MatchSource,RiotOk decisionNode
